explain (costs off, verbose)
select floor(v_float8), count(*) from src group by 1;
                        QUERY PLAN                         
-----------------------------------------------------------
 GroupAggregate
   Output: (floor(v_float8)), count(*)
   Group Key: floor(src.v_float8)
   ->  Index Only Scan using src_v_float8_idx on slope.src
